<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">perception</ansi>

<ansi fg="cyan">Perception</ansi> measures your awareness, intuition, and eye for opportunity.
A perceptive fighter strikes with precision and is difficult to catch off guard.

<ansi fg="yellow">Combat</ansi>

* Increases your critical hit damage. A critical blow does {{ config "GamePlay.Combat.CritMultMin" }}x damage, and
  each point of Perception over your target's adds 1/{{ config "GamePlay.Combat.StatEdgeSpan" }} of the way to
  {{ config "GamePlay.Combat.CritMultMax" }}x (<ansi fg="command">help stat-edge</ansi>).
* Moves your chance to dodge incoming attacks: {{ config "GamePlay.Combat.DodgeChanceEven" }}% at an even match, and
  each point of Perception over your attacker's adds 1/{{ config "GamePlay.Combat.StatEdgeSpan" }} of the way to {{ config "GamePlay.Combat.DodgeChanceMax" }}%
  (each point under takes it toward {{ config "GamePlay.Combat.DodgeChanceMin" }}%), on top of your Evasion against their
  Attack (<ansi fg="command">help evasion</ansi>). A shield-bearer blocks instead (<ansi fg="command">help defense</ansi>), and
  a burdened or heavily armored fighter dodges less (<ansi fg="command">help burden</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help armor</ansi>).
* Adds a small flat damage bonus to unarmed attacks.

<ansi fg="yellow">Economy</ansi>

* Helps you spot a good deal. Higher perception earns you better prices when
  bartering with merchants.
</ansi>
